# Build context: the build toolchain only. Everything else is cargo's job.
*
!Dockerfile
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/**
!src/**
# Offline builds only: the repo commits neither dir (see .gitignore), but a
# staged vendor/ plus .cargo/config.toml must still reach the builder when
# CARGO_OFFLINE=true.
!vendor/**
!.cargo/**
